{"type":"message","id":"fddff8e8","parentId":"6154ae1b","timestamp":"2026-04-16T22:56:03.947Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have enough context. Let me look at the article that has code details and design the solution for Delonix (德胧集团).\n\nThe key insights:\n1. 金谷园skill基于MCP协议开发\n2. 包含6个核心场景：餐厅信息、外卖服务、生饺子打包、排队系统等\n3. SKILL.md是核心，包含元数据+Agent指令\n4. 发布到GitHub，然后可以一键安装\n\nFor Delonix (德胧集团), I need to create:\n1. A methodology document for how to create skills for each hotel\n2. A template skill that can be reused\n3. A tool/workflow to batch publish to multiple platforms (GitHub, Gitee, ClawHub, etc.)\n\nLet me write the solution. I'll create:\n1. `/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/hotel-skill-generator/` - A skill generator for hotels\n2. The actual generator code\n3. A methodology document\n\nLet me start writing this comprehensive solution."},{"type":"text","text":"了解了！金谷园的skill基于MCP协议、SKILL.md是核心、发布到GitHub，然后一键安装。让我为德胧设计完整的skill生成+多平台发布方案。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_hixefldf1dwo_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"mkdir -p ~/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/hotel-skill-generator"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776380155616,"responseId":"06309bfb3088424dacd986fa3905e750"}}
