{"type":"message","id":"5d16f334","parentId":"780a1785","timestamp":"2026-04-16T23:42:41.873Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is giving me a GitHub token and wants me to directly push to GitHub. They mentioned there's a project called \"web-form-ai-filler\" and they want it pushed to GitHub. But wait - the main request is about the hotel-skill-generator project, not that other project.\n\nLet me re-read the context. The user (晁留柱) said:\n1. They want to add promotion capability to the overall design\n2. They're authorizing me with a GitHub token: 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\n3. They gave instructions about adding project description, creating release, etc.\n4. They mention a different repo: web-form-ai-filler\n\nBut the main request from before was about creating the hotel-skill-generator. Let me check what's in the current workspace and push the hotel-skill-generator to GitHub.\n\nActually, looking at the message, it seems like 晁留柱 is sharing a GitHub repo (web-form-ai-filler) and instructions. But his main instruction is to push the hotel-skill-generator project we just created.\n\nWait, re-reading again - the \"@_all 全体添加，学习、迭代\" in the replied message suggests this is about the hotel-skill-generator project that was just created. The user wants me to push this to GitHub.\n\nThe GitHub token provided is: 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\n\nLet me:\n1. Check if the hotel-skill-generator exists\n2. Set up git remote with the token\n3. Push to GitHub\n4. Create a release\n\nBut I should also check if there's a specific GitHub org/repo for Delonix (德胧). The token appears to be for user \"chaoliuzhu65-tech\" based on the repo URL mentioned.\n\n\nI'll verify the project structure, configure git authentication with the provided token, and proceed with pushing to GitHub using the appropriate repository path."},{"type":"text","text":"收到！马上推送hotel-skill-generator到GitHub！\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"cal