{"type":"message","id":"570981a4","parentId":"dbb92b0f","timestamp":"2026-04-16T23:46:21.906Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Empty response - seems curl can't connect to github.com either. This is a network connectivity issue.\n\nLet me try using the browser to upload the files, or create a different approach - maybe I can provide the complete solution in a format that can be easily pushed later, or use a workaround.\n\nActually, let me check if there's any way to get files to GitHub. Since direct network access seems blocked, let me:\n\n1. Save the content as a downloadable format\n2. Create a comprehensive README that can be easily copied\n3. Provide clear instructions for manual upload\n\nActually, wait - looking at the history again, I see the user is in China (based on references to 微信, 飞书, 美团, etc.). Maybe there's a way to use Gitee (Chinese GitHub alternative) instead? But that requires different setup.\n\nLet me focus on what I CAN do:\n1. The files are created locally\n2. I need to find a way to push them\n3. Or provide clear manual instructions\n\nSince network seems blocked, let me create the files properly and provide a comprehensive response with all the details needed to manually push or use an alternative method.\n\nLet me also try using git with a proxy or different approach."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6m7sdwa79qsk_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Test different network approaches\necho \"=== Testing network ===\"\ncurl -s --max-time 5 -o /dev/null -w \"github.com: %{http_code}\\n\" https://api.github.com 2>/dev/null || echo \"api.github.com: timeout\"\ncurl -s --max-time 5 -o /dev/null -w \"uploads.github.com: %{http_code}\\n\" https://uploads.github.com 2>/dev/null || echo \"uploads.github.com: timeout\"","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":