{"type":"message","id":"d300f102","parentId":"d0d4ba65","timestamp":"2026-04-16T23:47:04.534Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"No SSH key exists, and we can't push via HTTPS either. Let me use the GitHub API directly to push content. I'll need to:\n\n1. Create a blob for each file\n2. Create a tree structure\n3. Create a commit\n4. Update the reference\n\nThis is more complex but should work with API calls only.\n\nActually, let me try a simpler approach - use the GitHub API contents endpoint which allows creating/updating single files."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ckqdbs34hjwj_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Create files via GitHub API contents endpoint\n# First encode the files as base64\n\ncd ~/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/hotel-skill-generator\n\n# Function to create/update file via API\ncreate_or_update_file() {\n  local path=\"$1\"\n  local message=\"$2\"\n  local content=$(base64 -w 0 \"$path\")\n  \n  curl -s -X PUT \\\n    -H \"Authorization: token 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\" \\\n    -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    https://api.github.com/repos/chaoliuzhu65-tech/hotel-skill-generator/contents/\"$path\" \\\n    -d \"{\n      \\\"message\\\": \\\"$message\\\",\n      \\\"content\\\": \\\"$content\\\"\n    }\" | head -10\n}\n\necho \"=== Pushing SKILL.md ===\"\nbase64 -w 0 SKILL.md > /tmp/skill_b64.txt\ncurl -s -X PUT \\\n  -H \"Authorization: token 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\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  https://api.github.com/repos/chaoliuzhu65-tech/hotel-skill-generator/contents/SKILL.md \\\n  -d @- << 'EOF' | head -20\n{\n  \"message\": \"feat: add SKILL.md\",\n  \"content\": \"$(cat /tmp/skill_b64.txt)\"\n}\nEOF","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cach