{"type":"message","id":"42dfc6f4","parentId":"2744c210","timestamp":"2026-04-16T23:47:28.296Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The files are pushed. Now I need to create a release with the v1.0.0 tag. Let me do that via the API."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_cnt77veylstm_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Create the v1.0.0 release\ncat > /tmp/release.json << 'EOF'\n{\n  \"tag_name\": \"v1.0.0\",\n  \"target_commitish\": \"main\",\n  \"title\": \"v1.0.0 - Initial Release\",\n  \"body\": \"# 德胧酒店Skill生成器 v1.0.0\\n\\n## 🚀 简介\\n\\n德胧集团酒店AI Skill批量生成器，让每家酒店都拥有专属AI技能！\\n\\n## 📦 包含内容\\n\\n- **SKILL.md** - 元技能核心文档\\n- **ARCHITECTURE.md** - 整体设计方案\\n- **examples/** - 天津瑞湾开元名都示例\\n- **scripts/** - 发布和生成脚本\\n\\n## 🛠️ 使用方法\\n\\n```bash\\n# 克隆仓库\\ngit clone https://github.com/chaoliuzhu65-tech/hotel-skill-generator.git\\ncd hotel-skill-generator\\n\\n# 查看文档\\ncat SKILL.md\\ncat ARCHITECTURE.md\\n```\\n\\n## 📚 方法论\\n\\n本项目实现了\\\"如何指挥AI搭建Skill\\\"的方法论：\\n\\n1. **定义触发词** - 用户怎么称呼这个酒店/服务\\n2. **整理知识库** - 地址、电话、营业时间、特色服务\\n3. **设计交互场景** - 用户会问什么？怎么回答？\\n\\n## 🌐 发布平台\\n\\n支持一键发布到：\\n- GitHub（已开源）\\n- ClawHub（OpenClaw生态）\\n- 扣子Coze（国内AI平台）\\n\\n---\\n\\n*本项目由德胧AI龙虾军团开发*\",\n  \"draft\": false,\n  \"prerelease\": false\n}\nEOF\n\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -H \"Authorization: token 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\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  https://api.github.com/repos/chaoliuzhu65-tech/hotel-skill-generator/releases \\\n  -d @/tmp/release.json | grep -E '\"id\"|\"tag_name\"|\"name\"|\"html_url\"|\"upload_url\"' | head -10","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776383238312,"responseId":"0630a80642b31ff4a0b188c8ebac8d73"}}
