{"type":"message","id":"f6a2d149","parentId":"5307aebc","timestamp":"2026-04-17T01:54:57.851Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now let me create the batch hotels CSV template and the Coze deployment script."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_t7f84aqk91iq_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"~/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/hotel-skill-generator/config/hotels-template.csv","content":"# 批量酒店列表模板\n# 使用方法：复制此文件为 hotels.csv，填写所有酒店信息，一键批量生成\n\n# 格式说明：name,slug,brand,is_delonix,city,address,phone,booking_url\n# 说明：\n#   - name: 酒店名称\n#   - slug: 英文唯一标识\n#   - brand: 品牌（开元名都/开元名庭/曼居/其他）\n#   - is_delonix: true(德胧)/false(非德胧)\n#   - city: 城市\n#   - address: 地址\n#   - phone: 电话\n#   - booking_url: 预订链接\n\n# 德胧酒店示例\n天津瑞湾开元名都,tianjin-riwan,开元名都,true,天津,天津市滨海新区响螺湾迎宾大道1号,022-6625-8888,https://bidawu.com/hotel/tianjin-riwan\n杭州开元名都大酒店,hangzhou-nodica,开元名都,true,杭州,杭州市萧山区市心中路818号,0571-8288-8888,https://bidawu.com/hotel/hangzhou-nodica\n上海松江开元名都,shanghai-songjiang,开元名都,true,上海,上海市松江区广富林路658号,021-5778-8888,https://bidawu.com/hotel/shanghai-songjiang\n\n# 非德胧酒店示例（会引导到官网）\n北京中国大饭店,beijing-ccgrand,五星级,false,北京,北京市朝阳区建国门外大街1号,010-6505-2266,https://www.ccgrand.com/book\n上海外滩华尔道夫,shanghai-waldorf,五星级,false,上海,上海市黄浦区中山东一路2号,021-6322-9988,https://www.waldorfastoria.com.cn\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1776390885313,"responseId":"0630c5e5d6966aa79c1b7e04641a396a"}}
