2026 files changed 2 2 . changeset / shaggy - pets - call ...","siteName":""},{"title":"feat: git provider abstraction for GitHub + GitLab support","url":"https://github.com/SiliconSaga/yggdrasil/pull/31","description":"sh...\nAdds a provider abstraction for git hosts: new dispatcher and provider modules (GitHub/GitLab), refactors workspace scripts to call gp_* provider functions for push/PR/issue/review flows, changes remote detection and auth handling to be provider-agnostic, and replaces GitHub-only docs with multi-provider guidance.\nChanges\n<table>\n<tr><th>Cohort / File(s)</th><th>Summary</th></tr>\n<tr><td>Provider framework\n","siteName":""},{"title":"[Feature] Trusted Publishing for Skills via GitHub / GitLab Actions OIDC #991","url":"https://github.com/openclaw/clawhub/issues/991","description":"GitHub Actions workflow — Authors add a simple workflow to their skill repo:\nAn action can be published that would sit within the code cloud providers actions / ci , as have pypi and other communities\nhttps://github.com/marketplace/actions/pypi-publish\nProvenance attestation - When publishing via trusted publishing, ClawHub records the GitHub repository, commit SHA, workflow run URL, and ref alongside the skill version, displayed on the skill's page for consumers to verify....\n","siteName":""},{"title":"content-publishing","url":"https://github.com/topics/content-publishing","description":"#\ncontent-publishing\nHere are 20 public repositories matching this topic...\nartipub / artipub\nartipub: Simplify your cross-platform article publishing with a straightforward API. Publish content seamlessly to blogs, social media, and more without manual intervention. Perfect for content creators looking to expand their reach effortlessly.\napi automation social-media typescript content-creation content-publishing\nUpdated Dec 7, 2025\nTypeScript\nInterestWatcher-Xia...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"AGI-Super-Team/skills/github-automation/SKILL.md at master · aAAaqwq/AGI-Super-Team · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/aAAaqwq/AGI-Super-Team/blob/master/skills/github-automation/SKILL.md","description":"aAAaqwq\n636ec3f · Feb 19, 2026\n396 lines (341 loc) · 9.21 KB\n<table>\n<tr><th>name</th><th>description</th><th>allowed-tools</th></tr>\n<tr><td>github-automation</td><td>自动化 GitHub 操作。当用户需要推送代码到 GitHub、管理仓库、创建 PR...\n","siteName":""},{"title":"push-all-in-one","url":"https://github.com/CaoMeiYouRen/push-all-in-one","description":"Supports multiple push methods including Server Chan (and Server Chan³), custom email, DingTalk robot, WeChat Work robot, WeChat Work application, Feishu, pushplus, WxPusher, iGot, Qmsg, XiZhi, PushDeer, Discord, OneBot, Telegram, ntfy and more.\n温馨提示：出于安全考虑， 所有 推送方式请在 服务端 使用！请勿在 客户端(网页端) 使用！\n","siteName":""},{"title":"GitHub - jterrazz/package-broadcast: Multi-channel broadcast system for distributing announcements across platforms. · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/jterrazz/package-broadcast","description":"<table>\n<tr><td>\njterrazz</td></tr>\n<tr><td>.github/workflows</td><td>.github/workflows</td><td>Migrate to @jterrazz/test v5.0.0 + add Given/Then comments to all tests</td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td>skills/jterrazz-broadcast</td><td>skills/jterrazz-broadcast</td><td...\n","siteName":""}]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1776391331245}}
